{%- doc -%}
  Delivery and payment terms near Add to cart (docs/offers-plan.md §6): Baymard found 27% of shoppers miss offers
  that only live in a site-wide banner, so the product page says them again where people decide. Equal cells side
  by side, an icon over a short label of two lines at most; with four terms (once COD is on) a two-by-two grid with
  the icon beside the text, because four cells don't fit a 360px screen. The product page puts this in a card with
  the WhatsApp line under it (.assure in sections/product.liquid). Every part comes from Theme settings, so it
  can't disagree with the cart or the announcement bar: free shipping and COD only once they're switched on.
  "Replacement if damaged", not "easy returns": there are no change-of-mind returns (docs/legal/terms-of-service.html
  §6). It links to the refund policy once that exists.

  @example
  {% render 'offer-terms' %}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- assign threshold = settings.free_shipping_threshold | default: 0 | times: 100 -%}
<ul class="offer-terms" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'offers.label' | t }}">
  {%- if threshold > 0 -%}
    {%- assign amount = threshold | money_without_trailing_zeros -%}
    <li>{%- render 'icon', icon: 'truck' -%}<span>{{ 'announcement.free_shipping' | t: amount: amount }}</span></li>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if settings.cod_available -%}
    <li>{%- render 'icon', icon: 'cash' -%}<span>{{ 'announcement.cod' | t }}</span></li>
  {%- endif -%}
  <li>{%- render 'icon', icon: 'package' -%}<span>{{ 'cart.ships' | t }}</span></li>
  <li>
    {%- render 'icon', icon: 'replace' -%}
    {%- if shop.refund_policy -%}
      <a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">{{ 'offers.replace' | t }}</a>
    {%- else -%}
      <span>{{- 'offers.replace' | t -}}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </li>
</ul>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* The 1px gaps show the list's own colour as hairlines, whatever the number of columns. With large text the
     cells no longer fit side by side and stack. */
  .offer-terms {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(5.5rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--color-line-strong);
    font-size: .8125rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .offer-terms li {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-2);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .offer-terms:has(li:nth-child(4)) { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(max(8.5rem, 34%), 1fr)); }
  .offer-terms:has(li:nth-child(4)) li { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; align-items: center; justify-items: start; gap: var(--space-2); padding-inline: var(--space-3); text-align: left; }
  .offer-terms .icon { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; color: var(--color-heading); }
  .offer-terms a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 40%, transparent); }
  @media (hover: hover) { .offer-terms a:hover { text-decoration-color: currentColor; } }
{% endstylesheet %}
